OL,5,G1340 Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FDundee. Kim plans a
OL,7,     F'Yorkshire-themed' menu -
OL,8,     Ffeaturing dishes from Spain and
OL,9,     FThailand - accompanied by a
OL,10,     FScottish choir singing American
OL,11,     Fsongs. (Ep5/5)
OL,12,G1415 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe first visit is to Newton House
OL,14,     Fin Knaresborough, North Yorkshire,
OL,15,     Frun by organic foodies Denise
OL,16,     FCarter and Jackie Fennell, who are
OL,17,     Fconfident that their breakfasts
OL,18,     Fhave set the bar high.
