OL,5,G1450 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe second visit is to the
OL,7,     FHighlands Pub in Blackpool, where
OL,8,     FMike Hayes and Neal Widdowson are
OL,9,     Fall about value for money. But
OL,10,     Fthere are North/South divisions at
OL,11,     Fdinner.
OL,12,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FTensions simmer as the guests head
OL,14,     Fto The White House in Brighton,
OL,15,     Frun by Sean Edlin and Kathryn
OL,16,     FTurnbull, and the group have to
OL,17,     Fdecide whether they're getting
OL,18,     Fvalue for money.
