OL,11,     Fbreakfast hamper is anything but.
OL,12,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor the last time to settle some
OL,16,     Fscores. Denise and Jackie wait to
OL,17,     Fsee if high marks will translate
OL,18,     Finto high payments.
